ind":"update","title":"🚨 Patch 0.2.0: Police Raids, Crypto Theft, and Steam Achievements!","summary":"Fresh Teen Hustler Update (Patch 0.2.0): Police Raids, Crypto Defense, and Steam Achievements!Hey, hustlers! Development is in full swing: a massive update just dropped, turning the survival grind into a real criminal techno-thriller.Here is a breakdown of the key features live in the game right now: 🔨 1. 3D Evidence Destruction Workbench (Police Raid!)When your Wanted Level hits a critical 100% — expect company. SWAT is breaching the door with sirens wailing, and you have only seconds to destro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T11:30:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4835840-1836506165578728","game_id":"steam-4835840","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.1.2: Chinese Language Added & UI Improvements","summary":"Hello hackers!A fresh update for the Teen Hustler demo is now live.What's new in Patch 0.1.2:Localization: Added Simplified Chinese. Now even more players can comfortably hack systems and complete contracts without a language barrier!Interface: Tweaked the main menu UI to make it look cleaner and more intuitive.Minor fixes: Under-the-hood optimizations for better stability.I'm continuing to polish the game. Thank you for your feedback! Let me know in the discussions if you find any bugs.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T18:19:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4835840-1836506165578638","game_id":"steam-4835840","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Q&A: Building a Hacker Simulator Together 💻","summary":"Hi! I'm the solo developer of the indie simulator Teen Hustler. Right now, I'm actively refining the game mechanics for the upcoming festivals, and I'd love to chat with you!Feel free to ask any questions in the comments below this post. For example:How does the heat system work, and why does the SWAT team breach the door so fast?What new features are coming to the ShadowNet dark web market?What is it like developing a game completely solo?I will be checking the comments regularly and replying t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T17:32:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4835840-1836506165576643","game_id":"steam-4835840","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.1.1: Full English Localization & Bug Fixes (Demo Update)","summary":"In this small but important patch, I am focused on fully translating the game into English, fixing task logic, and improving the overall user experience.🌐 Localization & TextShadowShop: The darknet store (ShadowShop) is now fully translated. All hacker monitors, server racks, and furniture items now correctly display in English.ShadowNet Diagnostics: The Gateway Diagnostics button and other UI elements in the ShadowNet terminal have been translated.Messenger:The word for \"Day\" in message dates i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T20:05:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4835840-1836506165571453","game_id":"steam-4835840","kind":"update","title":"Patch Note 0.0.1","summary":"Patch Notes:1. Performance Optimization 